HST Office: Slides' galleries fit the ribbon: the theme gallery narrows before it folds, no gallery makes it taller.

Owner decision (14/11/2026), from the after-v2 screenshots:
- Slides ▸ Thiết kế at 1366 px folded "Chủ đề ▾" beside about 520 px of empty room: the theme gallery was 6 themes
  wide at every width. It now shows 6, 4 or 3 themes in a row at the ribbon's large, medium and small states,
  so the ladder narrows it before folding the group (svx ThemeColorsPaneWrapper answers the new window
  property "hst-gallery-state", which vcl HstRibbonLadder.cxx sends to the item windows of a group's toolboxes;
  windows that do not know it ignore it; the .ui's fixed 6 columns go, the columns follow the width).
- On Windows the Thiết kế, Chuyển tiếp and Hoạt hình tabs were taller than the others and their group captions
  went down: the Windows icon view asked for the height of every row. The theme gallery is at most 96 px high
  and the transition and animation galleries 76 px (one row; on Linux they are 88 and 62 px, unchanged).

License: these upstream files remain under their original license (MPL-2.0).
Test: build only (every C++ file syntax-checked against the configured tree); tests/unit/test_ribbon_layout_rules.py
reads the patch. Runtime: Slides ▸ Thiết kế at 1366 px shows the theme gallery; Windows: Thiết kế, Chuyển tiếp and
Hoạt hình keep the ribbon height of the other tabs.
